      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "I have a large used kit collection. Everywhere I go, I tend to find a thrift store for a fun find. I, of course, have many West Ham kits. My crown jewel is a 2010 Mark Noble. I have a 2014 Portsmouth. A long-sleeved Uganda. Obscure is better. My newest additions: Cambridge, Dover, Oldham and York",
      "likes": 21,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-07T15:13:01.378Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzq6p4k2hs2g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I like that the Brooks one also works for an Orioles game",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "mumbleoutage.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I sense collecting UK ⚽️ stadiums and kits is just as exciting as doing the same with MLB ⚾️ stadiums and jerseys.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "michaelcdickens.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "中古のキット（ユニフォーム）をたくさん集めています。どこへ行っても古着屋を探して掘り出し物を探すのが習慣。もちろんウェストハムのキットは多数。至宝は2010年のマーク・ノーブル。2014年のポーツマス、長袖のウガンダも。マニアックなほど good。最新の仲間はケンブリッジ、ドーバー、オールダム、ヨーク"
    },
